  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "2e9b289230cd2da1",
  "text": "Owl says: read the story, then ask what is happening. Hedgie adds when parts come together and takes away when some go. How many more compares two numbers: take the smaller from the larger!",
  "source": "lesson-story"
 },
 {
  "key": "311d471061f2e9b7",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 1. Now it's 17.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
