  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 },
 {
  "key": "c3a5fe94f9fd2264",
  "text": "It's getting late. See you tomorrow!",
  "source": "owl-line"
 },
 {
  "key": "c3ead4d41b65ce98",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 1. Now it's 4.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "c4a675341447f9fa",
  "text": "Which number has 3 hundreds, 7 tens and 4 ones?",
  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 },
 {
  "key": "c53b95e8f117daab",
  "text": "Rows go across, like lines in a book.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "c57efb21cf822a27",
  "text": "Each row has 3.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "c59d7bf15dd97102",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 2. Now it's 13.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "c63f6dc6adabc830",
  "text": "You add 3. Now it's 5.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "c6eada1aee95a131",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 3. Now it's 10.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "c77327be0979937f",
  "text": "Check the digits' order. This one is tricky. Want an easier one?",
  "source": "exercise-note-easier-offer"
 },
 {
  "key": "c916003b70ea4f4b",
  "text": "You add 2. Now it's 13.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "ca35c8729d0513f6",
  "text": "Today Hedgie has new puzzles for you!",
  "source": "home"
 },
 {
  "key": "ca4d21d94d8481a1",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 3. Now it's 11.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "ca7844242aea789b",
  "text": "Help the market animals with their orders!",
  "source": "minigame-goal"
 },
 {
  "key": "cb29077c74b6295c",
  "text": "Round 36 to the nearest ten.",
  "source": "lesson-guided"
 },
 {
  "key": "cb70b23f2da8b321",
  "text": "You add 1. Now it's 19.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "cbf8e94487696c76",
  "text": "Build 465 with blocks.",
  "source": "lesson-variant"
 },
 {
  "key": "cc709ec683c1c3d2",
  "text": "You already know Number Meadow — 5 lessons are yours!",
  "source": "assessment"
 },
 {
  "key": "ccf6fedb3c929223",
  "text": "Owl says: a number line is a path of numbers. Every jump is the same size. Hedgie counts the jumps, not the marks!",
  "source": "lesson-story"
 },
 {
  "key": "ce178f1e32174476",
  "text": "Check the tens. This one is tricky. Want an easier one?",
  "source": "exercise-note-easier-offer"
 },
 {
  "key": "ce2d8a3230330bf8",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 1. Now it's 18.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "cf1f3ea87282ebbb",
  "text": "Look: 3 thousands, 4 hundreds, 0 tens and 5 ones. The zero keeps the tens place, so the number is 3405!",
  "source": "lesson-demo"
 },
 {
  "key": "d0b83b75666ac812",
  "text": "About where is 36? Put it on the line.",
  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 },
 {
  "key": "d1246d33bc6e8f64",
  "text": "Halve the tens and the ones.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "d18513e39b012798",
  "text": "You already know 2 worlds! Off you go!",
  "source": "placement"
 },
 {
  "key": "d31d36fd7746c990",
  "text": "You add 3. Now it's 14.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "d3b714da95dd88b0",
  "text": "Ten changes the tens digit. A hundred changes the hundreds digit.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "d566676799134a64",
  "text": "Take turns adding 1, 2 or 3. Whoever says 20 wins!",
  "source": "minigame-goal"
 },
 {
  "key": "d5ceec6d7afc7712",
  "text": "Not there yet. Look at the numbers on the line. This one is tricky. Want an easier one?",
  "source": "exercise-note-easier-offer"
 },
 {
  "key": "d613e260099c3187",
  "text": "Round 73 to the nearest ten.",
  "source": "lesson-guided"
 },
 {
  "key": "d65b52496f284b7e",
  "text": "About where is 726? Put it on the line.",
  "source": "minigame-round"
 },
 {
  "key": "d75754ab245a594d",
  "text": "You add 1. Now it's 1.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "d7c88efc4ca7fb18",
  "text": "Number Builder. Master Number Meadow and beat Number Train",
  "source": "badge-locked"
 },
 {
  "key": "d8eff244a0581f64",
  "text": "Penguin had 21 fish. Then Penguin caught 68 more. How many fish does Penguin have now?",
  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 },
 {
  "key": "d96b4cd87383bac7",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 3. Now it's 3.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "d99d6ff37723fc4e",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 1. Now it's 10.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "d9dd9bde2ed22057",
  "text": "It starts with 2.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "da02480e32d8e79f",
  "text": "Look: 3 groups of 4 berries. 4 plus 4 plus 4 makes 12. So 3 times 4 is 12!",
  "source": "lesson-demo"
 },
 {
  "key": "da33bd9fbb37459d",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 2. Now it's 12.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "daa7607030a5296c",
  "text": "Times Ranger. Master Times-Table Forest and beat Race to 20",
  "source": "badge-locked"
 },
 {
  "key": "daa81d68cfea911f",
  "text": "Count the rows and the dots in each row. This one is tricky. Want an easier one?",
  "source": "exercise-note-easier-offer"
 },
 {
  "key": "dad9535645e6f516",
  "text": "You add 3. Now it's 10.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "dbb69e7ce5923ab7",
  "text": "Double the tens and the ones.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "dc7817cf955c3205",
  "text": "You add 1. Now it's 8.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "df2624415285f288",
  "text": "Read the numbers on every mark.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "dfe3e013f29e8780",
  "text": "Star Counter, Silver",
  "source": "badge-earned"
 },
 {
  "key": "e0a2d2fdbfa32f53",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 1. Now it's 1.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "e0edbe07995e3f02",
  "text": "You add 1. Now it's 17.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "e1589fc0260027c1",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 2. Now it's 2.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "e173ccd43e93cb3d",
  "text": "You add 3. Now it's 9.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "e1b44f2ca89f0fd0",
  "text": "Read it again: does the number get bigger or smaller? This one is tricky. Want an easier one?",
  "source": "exercise-note-easier-offer"
 },
 {
  "key": "e259a020f02b6c7b",
  "text": "Not that number. Try again! This one is tricky. Want an easier one?",
  "source": "exercise-note-easier-offer"
 },
 {
  "key": "e29a85c71abdc97b",
  "text": "Make 5 rows of 6 dots. Tap the bottom-right dot.",
  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 },
 {
  "key": "e52750feae9515f1",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 3. Now it's 19.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "e5fb2fa02a3b5b00",
  "text": "Is this the nearest hundred?",
  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 },
 {
  "key": "e6a0f233f311e3d6",
  "text": "Put 40 on the number line.",
  "source": "minigame-round"
 },
 {
  "key": "e6b599793b3c2ee7",
  "text": "Right in the middle? It goes up to the bigger number.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "e6dd3db7d2a21a07",
  "text": "Let's keep going!",
  "source": "home"
 },
 {
  "key": "e7c0878a15db2d00",
  "text": "5 minutes left — pick something short!",
  "source": "owl-line"
 },
 {
  "key": "e91718e2be6ab8c7",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 1. Now it's 5.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "e9385dbcd47a07e8",
  "text": "You add 2. Now it's 11.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "ea84ac0ce99132c7",
  "text": "What is 5 times 8?",
  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 },
 {
  "key": "eb32157eec149332",
  "text": "What is 2 times 3?",
  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 },
 {
  "key": "eb34c8b42b309aa6",
  "text": "Look: 2 hundreds, 0 tens and 5 ones. The zero holds the tens place, so the number is 205!",
  "source": "lesson-demo"
 },
 {
  "key": "eb38c824f5e02ab2",
  "text": "Make 3 rows of 2 dots. Tap the bottom-right dot.",
  "source": "lesson-guided"
 },
 {
  "key": "ecd4fe369e2640df",
  "text": "Not quite! Try again.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "edad47c41e024917",
  "text": "What is 7 times 6? 5 times 7 is 35, and one more 7 makes 42. So 7 times 6 is 42!",
  "source": "lesson-demo"
 },
 {
  "key": "edc2fb378ffb2159",
  "text": "You add 2. Now it's 4.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "f00eed6db8aa147e",
  "text": "You add 2. Now it's 10.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "f02bd9577fdf2ef6",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 3. Now it's 15.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "f0400873f412a4f3",
  "text": "The tens make 90, then the ones make 10 more.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "f04de88ae98dc1d1",
  "text": "One choice is ruled out.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "f2087dd0faf75226",
  "text": "World boss time: Number Train!",
  "source": "home"
 },
 {
  "key": "f2321411643ad211",
  "text": "Hedgie adds 2. Now it's 19.",
  "source": "race-bot-adds"
 },
 {
  "key": "f2b6e360840d81d6",
  "text": "Make a ten first. What is the total?",
  "source": "lesson-variant"
 },
 {
  "key": "f2d1457382e5d95b",
  "text": "Your turn",
  "source": "duel"
 },
 {
  "key": "f42fcc11d901f393",
  "text": "What is half of 76?",
  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 },
 {
  "key": "f487d4b4b1fb49c4",
  "text": "You already know Times-Table Forest — 6 lessons are yours!",
  "source": "assessment"
 },
 {
  "key": "f4f8438175b5bd11",
  "text": "Find the middle: 250.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "f609b76c4e0cec84",
  "text": "Each place holds one digit: 2 hundreds is 200, not 2000.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "f808c122a4ca0ec7",
  "text": "You add 1. Now it's 5.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "f80c8fc3dcb61f21",
  "text": "Not that one. Try another!",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "f86e11534ab08fc5",
  "text": "You add 1. Now it's 11.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "f89a68d2a4f38591",
  "text": "What is 1 times 3?",
  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 },
 {
  "key": "f8a8d6765088815f",
  "text": "Every math whiz starts with the first step.",
  "source": "placement"
 },
 {
  "key": "fadb0a787446c172",
  "text": "Already know some math? Let's find out where to start you!",
  "source": "placement"
 },
 {
  "key": "fd54e9d950e62f0f",
  "text": "You add 2. Now it's 3.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "fd878664d98e2fc0",
  "text": "Compare the biggest place first.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "fef7f4fb8ac12912",
  "text": "Owl says: to times by 4, double the number, then double it again. Hedgie knows that 8 is double 4, so for eights double one more time!",
  "source": "lesson-story"
 },
 {
  "key": "ff0ec01eabaf8fd3",
  "text": "You add 3. Now it's 17.",
  "source": "race-you-add"
 },
 {
  "key": "ff9e1b1facd7d976",
  "text": "It starts with 1.",
  "source": "exercise-note"
 },
 {
  "key": "ffebb8e81721c93a",
  "text": "Which is the answer?",
  "source": "lesson-exercise"
 }
]
